  <name>Rains County — Unmapped Historical Markers</name>
  <description>THC markers in Rains County without an HMDB id (isMissing excluded). 1 with THC coords; 0 geocoded from address; 0 omitted (no usable address). Orange pins are isPending=True — the marker may not be installed yet.</description>
  <Style id="normal">
    <IconStyle>
      <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/ms/icons/red-dot.png</href></Icon>
    </IconStyle>
  </Style>
  <Style id="pending">
    <IconStyle>
